    <primary-label ref="jirai"/>
    <secondary-label ref="jirai_version"/>

    <p>Need help or have suggestions for the JirAI plugin? Here are all the resources and contact options available.</p>

    <chapter title="Feature Requests and Bug Reports" id="feature-requests">
        <p>If you encounter an issue, have feedback, or would like to request new capabilities, please submit an issue on our <a href="https://github.com/edgafner/JirAI/issues">GitHub Issue Tracker</a>.</p>
        <p>When reporting issues, please include your IDE version, JirAI plugin version, and relevant excerpts from your IDE logs (<ui-path>Help | Show Log in Finder / Explorer</ui-path>).</p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Contact and Vendor Support" id="contact">
        <p>For licensing, enterprise inquiries, or immediate support, contact us directly at:</p>
        <p><emphasis><b>jgafner@dorkag.com</b></emphasis></p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Terms of Service and Privacy" id="legal">
